	(descr "Atari 5200 36-pin cartridge edge: 18 positions at 2.54 mm per face, pins 1-18 on F.Cu (label face, pin 1 = D0 at the left), pins 19-36 on B.Cu, pin k over pin 37-k.  Fingers 1.78 mm wide, copper 0.6-7.0 mm from the edge; pins 18 / 36 (interlock) short, from 1.9 mm.  Tab 47.8 mm.  Hard gold, 30-45 deg bevel.")
